  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">La Caravane de l&#x2019;Entrepreneur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Caravane de l&#x2019;Entrepreneur aims to increase awareness for entrepreneurship (both methods and concepts), change of mindset by showcasing role models, stimulate innovation and problem-solving among Senegalese students and potentially create a pipeline for the Orange Corners programme by means of a two-day workshop per university. Furthermore, Orange Corners Senegal will have more exposure outside of Dakar and will therefore become more inclusive for students from other regions of the country Senegalese knowledge institutes. Lastly, it gives an opportunity to collaborate with knowledge institutes in focus regions and therefore increases the network of the Netherlands Embassy in Dakar as well as possibly provides insights for the new flagship Technical and Vocational Education and Training (TVET) &amp; Higher Education programme.</narrative>
  </description>
